    "description": "Returns your company's letters ranked by open rate or click-to-open rate, best first. As a `v3` endpoint, it requires a company-derived API key.\n\nBy default the ranking covers a rolling 90-day window. To rank a specific period instead, pass both `from` and `to` (`YYYY-MM-DD`); passing only one of them is rejected, and `to` cannot be earlier than `from`.\n\nUse `channels[]` to restrict the ranking to specific channels. Each item includes `uniqueId`, `title`, `channel`, `organization`, `publicationDate`, `editionUrl`, and the counts behind the ranking (`delivered`, `opens`, `opensUnique`, `clicks`, `clicksUnique`).",
