    "summary": "Curate in bulk",
    "description": "Create multiple curations for any channel within the company. Note that the `v3` api requires a key generated from within the company-level settings.\n\nUnlike the single **Curate or update content** endpoint, `channels` here creates a separate curation per channel: list two channels and you get two curations, one on each, matched and updated independently by its own `url` (together with its type and, if it came from a feed, the feed it came from). Omit `channels` on a curation and it's created once as a single company-level curation instead, shared with every channel — the way the single endpoint's omitted `channels` works.\n\nIt accepts the same parameters as the `Curate` endpoint.",
